WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The local Storage Insights dashboard opens with a selected drive and its scan status.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
A non-overlapping chart explains free space, Windows files, applications, user content, development storage and unreadable space.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Storage evidence can be narrowed through file, folder and file-type views without silently starting another scan.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The interface keeps partial coverage, protected locations and review-only items visible while presenting the matching evidence.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Cleanup remains a separate confirmed action with live revalidation and Recycle Bin-only handling.
